@hint state.listStateEvents List state events (append-only log)
@hint fireStateEvent Fire a state transition event for an entity
@hint state.listStateMachines List state machines visible to the authenticated tenant
@hint state.createStateMachine Create a tenant-scoped state machine (or extension)
@hint adoptStateLibraryEntry Derive a tenant state machine from a State Library entry
@hint getStateMachine Get a state machine by ID
@hint getStateRegistry Get the State Registry summary for a tenant
@hint listStateTransitions List declared state transitions for a machine

@end
